### ==============================================
### VALIDATION CHECKS
### ==============================================
### ✓ Status should be "success"
### ✓ Count should match number of records in data array
### ✓ Data array contains positions with employee details
### ✓ Positions with job requisitions show profile name
### ✓ Orphan job requisitions (no position) have null employee/position fields
### ✓ All GUIDs are properly formatted
### ✓ Position statuses are "Open", "Filled", etc.

### ==============================================
### POWER PLATFORM API COMPARISON
### ==============================================
### Original Power Platform API URL:
### https://94dc3aefc027e3d1ace7ec4cd6d9dd.d1.environment.api.powerplatform.com:443/powerautomate/automations/direct/workflows/bd88a534738542149bbdf84784747997/triggers/manual/paths/invoke?api-version=1
###
### This .NET API provides the same response structure with:
### - User details from UserDetail table
### - Position information from Position table
### - Job requisition data from JobRequisition table
### - Job profile names from JobProfile table
### - Proper handling of null relationships
